cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this framework, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MOEMOI — Most Optimal and Ever More Optimal Intelligence"
abstract: >
  MOEMOI is an open, testable framework built around a single claim: every intelligent system
  runs the same underlying process to get from where it is to somewhere better. That process
  is the Intelligence Process (IP) — a six-substep recursive loop (Experience, Understand,
  Prioritise, Define, Prepare, Do/Learn -- EUPDDL).
  The framework grounds each step in convergent evidence from cognitive science, decision
  theory, predictive coding, and AI research, and makes every significant assertion as a
  numbered, falsifiable claim tracked with a confidence level and pre-registered kill-line.
